      "value": "I have been informed that it apparently has never done that, but this is based entirely off the official VRChat documentation\n\n\"This component will automatically sync the Transform (position, rotation scale) and Rigidbody (physics) of the object you put it on.\"\n\nhttps://udonsharp.docs.vrchat.com/vrchat-api#vrcobjectsync",
